WEBVTT

00:06:59.115 --> 00:07:00.250
CSB: Wonderful.

00:07:00.283 --> 00:07:02.752
Well, thank you so much
for this conversation, Nina.

00:07:02.752 --> 00:07:04.254
We have come to the end,

00:07:04.287 --> 00:07:06.623
but really grateful to you for joining us.

00:07:06.656 --> 00:07:07.791
Take care.

00:07:07.824 --> 00:07:10.093
NW: Thank you so much
for having me. Take care.